msgid "Mirë se vini në Albanix OS / Welcome to Albanix OS"
msgstr ""

msgid "Fast. Beautiful. Albanian. — Shpejtë. E bukur. Shqiptare."
msgstr ""

msgid "Welcome to Albanix OS, the Albanian-first Arch Linux distribution with KDE Plasma 6. This assistant will help you choose your language, keyboard, timezone, theme and optional software groups."
msgstr ""

msgid "Continue"
msgstr ""

msgid "Back"
msgstr ""

msgid "Finish"
msgstr ""

msgid "Gjuhë / Language"
msgstr ""

msgid "Choose the system language. Albanian is the default."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shqip (Albanian) — default"
msgstr ""

msgid "English"
msgstr ""

msgid "Tastaturë / Keyboard"
msgstr ""

msgid "Albanian (al) + English (us). Alt+Shift switches; AltGr/compose types ë and ç."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shqip (al)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Anglisht (us)"
msgstr ""

msgid "On a US keyboard: AltGr+e = ë, AltGr+c = ç (compose). Week starts Monday, dates dd.MM.yyyy, 24-hour clock."
msgstr ""

msgid "Orë / Timezone"
msgstr ""

msgid "Default Europe/Tirane (Albania). Kosovo users may choose Europe/Belgrade."
msgstr ""

msgid "Europe/Tirane — Shqipëri (default)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Europe/Belgrade — Kosovë"
msgstr ""

msgid "Both zones share UTC+1 / CEST. NTP will be enabled."
msgstr ""

msgid "Temë / Theme"
msgstr ""

msgid "Choose your Albanix theme. The whole system switches: Plasma, SDDM, Plymouth, wallpaper, Konsole, fastfetch, starship."
msgstr ""

msgid "Albanix Red — black & red (Albanian flag motif)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Red #E41E20 • Black #0B0B0F • Gold #D4A537"
msgstr ""

msgid "Albanix Blue — navy & gold (Kosovo flag motif)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Blue #244AA5 • Navy #07101F • Gold #D0A650"
msgstr ""

msgid "Paketë opsionale / Optional software"
msgstr ""

msgid "Select groups to install now. You can add more later with the albanix CLI."
msgstr ""

msgid "Developer — git, node, pnpm, python, rustup, docker, podman, VS Code OSS"
msgstr ""

msgid "Gaming — steam, proton-ge, gamemode, mangohud, lutris"
msgstr ""

msgid "Creator — obs, kdenlive, krita, gimp, inkscape, blender"
msgstr ""

msgid "Office — libreoffice, okular"
msgstr ""

msgid "Privacy — wireguard-tools, tor browser launcher"
msgstr ""

msgid "Përfatësia / Privacy"
msgstr ""

msgid "Albanix OS has no telemetry, no ads and no tracking. Nothing phones home except configured package mirrors and NTP servers."
msgstr ""

msgid "We do not collect or transmit any personal data. The only network contacts are the pacman mirrors you configure, NTP time servers, and Flathub for Flatpak updates — all optional and opt-outable."
msgstr ""

msgid "Këshilla / Tips"
msgstr ""

msgid "Open a terminal to see fastfetch. Switch themes anytime with albanix-theme red|blue. Benchmark with albanix-bench."
msgstr ""

msgid "Terminal: fastfetch runs on first open (per theme)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Theme switcher: albanix-theme red | albanix-theme blue."
msgstr ""

msgid "Benchmark: albanix-bench (prints a Markdown table)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Snapshots: snapper is configured; a snapshot is taken before every pacman upgrade."
msgstr ""

msgid "Firewall: ufw is enabled (deny incoming, allow outgoing)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mbarim / Done"
msgstr ""

msgid "Albanix OS is ready. Enjoy!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Your choices have been applied. Reopen this app anytime from the application menu (Albanix Welcome)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mirë se vini në Albanix OS / Welcome to Albanix OS"
msgstr ""
